-- Volume landmarks pass (2026-08-25). Owner pushed back on the claim that
-- the corpus had nothing on general volume landmarks: it was the FINDINGS
-- TABLE that lacked them, never the transcript corpus. A title-routed
-- sweep over 28 videos from the evidence-focused channels (Renaissance
-- Periodization, Stronger By Science, Data Driven Strength, House of
-- Hypertrophy, Jeff Nippard, Menno Henselmans, 3DMJ, Flow High
-- Performance) produced 170 raw findings; four topic distillers merged
-- them and four adversarial verifiers rejected 23 for invented or
-- inferred quantities, overstated confidence, or duplication. These are
-- the 69 survivors.
--
-- Confidence skews conservative on purpose: the verifiers downgraded any
-- claim a single hedged source carried. Genuine disagreements are NOT
-- flattened here -- they are recorded in docs/science/volume-landmarks.md
-- so Coach can say the field is split instead of picking a side.

